## Examples

**User:** "Fix the nav spacing" → edit `Layout.tsx` freely; no locked files involved.

**User:** "Change disabled text to white" → **stop**, list affected locked files and values, ask for confirmation before editing.

**User:** "Update brand 500 to #224488" → **stop**, confirm scope (palette SCSS, semantic.json, Color.tsx, etc.) and get approval first.
